menu "Si4684 tuner"

config SI4684_EMBEDDED_IMAGES
    bool "Embed the Si4684 firmware images in the app image"
    default y
    help
        Yes: the images in Firmware/Si4684-Firmware are linked into the app
        and copied once into the flash image store (Si4684ImageStore).
        No: the app reads them from that store only, so it contains no
        proprietary code and can be published (GitHub release builds).
        A radio must have run an embedding build once before it can run
        one without the images.

endmenu
